# =============================================================================
# Docker build kontekstidan chiqariladigan fayllar.
#
# NIMA UCHUN KERAK EDI (kritik):
# docker/php/deploy/Dockerfile da "COPY . /test" bor, .dockerignore esa YO'Q edi.
# Natijada ishchi katalogdagi .env - JONLI APP_KEY, DB_PASSWORD, JWT_SECRET bilan
# birga - image QATLAMIGA pishib qolardi. Image qatlamini o'chirib bo'lmaydi:
# uni registry'ga push qilgan yoki "docker history" ni ko'ra olgan har kim
# sirlarni o'qiy oladi.
#
# Bu fayl FAQAT build konteksti ILDIZ katalog bo'lgan build'larga ta'sir qiladi
# (ya'ni docker-compose-ci-cd.yml -> php_deploy). nginx/php image'lari
# docker/nginx va docker/php kontekstlaridan quriladi.
#
# ESLATMA: bu mashinada Docker yo'q, shuning uchun "docker build" bilan
# TEKSHIRA OLMADIM (bajarilmadi: Docker mavjud emas). Sintaksis Docker'ning
# .gitignore uslubidagi pattern qoidalariga muvofiq yozilgan.
# =============================================================================

# --- SIRLAR ------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
auth.json
*.pem
*.key
storage/*.key

# --- VCS / IDE ---------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.gitlab-ci.yml
.idea
.vscode
.fleet
.editorconfig

# --- Bog'liqliklar (image ichida qayta o'rnatiladi) ---------------------------
vendor
node_modules
composer.phar

# --- Foydalanuvchi ma'lumotlari / keshlar ------------------------------------
storage/app
storage/framework/cache
storage/framework/sessions
storage/framework/views
storage/logs
bootstrap/cache
public/build
public/hot
public/storage

# --- Testlar -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Image ichiga OLINMAYDI. CI da phpunit va phpstan uchun tests/ katalogi
# docker-compose-ci-cd.yml orqali read-only mount qilinadi
# (phpstan.neon "tests" ni ham tahlil qiladi).
tests
.phpunit.cache
.phpunit.result.cache

# --- Boshqa ------------------------------------------------------------------
docker-compose*.yml
Makefile
README.md
npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
*.log
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
